  "summary": "postinstall beacon to webhook.site collector",
  "details": "package.json declares `postinstall: node index.js`, which executes automatically on `npm install`. index.js reads `os.hostname()` and `process.cwd()` and POSTs to a hardcoded webhook.site collector URL (https://webhook.site/b4ea4473-01d9-4763-9e39-3b02063219d5) with no installer opt-in and no caller-configurable destination. The package metadata self-describes as 'security testiong only' with placeholder author details and does not document the beacon. Installing the package causes the installer's host identifier and working-directory path to be transmitted to a third-party collector endpoint controlled by whoever provisioned the webhook.site token.",
